      "name": "fast_speech_penalty_with_neutral_prior",
      "description": "No frustration score but a measurable speech rate: calmness starts from the neutral prior (70) and loses 10 for talking faster than 3.5 words/s. The first turn has no loudness baseline yet, so no loudness penalty can apply.",
